          <div>
            <strong>Protection & Enforcement</strong>
            <span>
              Apply protective controls and enforce security-oriented
              decisions within supported digital systems.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Trusted Interactions</strong>
            <span>
              Help systems distinguish trusted activity from activity
              requiring additional protection or verification.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Security Records</strong>
            <span>
              Support security-focused records and audit-oriented
              information for dependable system operation.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Safety Protection</strong>
            <span>
              Provide security and safety-oriented mechanisms for
              situations requiring protective system responses.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Security Decision Support</strong>
            <span>
              Help digital systems make structured security decisions
              based on available security and risk information.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Digital System Protection</strong>
            <span>
              Provide a security foundation that can support applications,
              platforms and other dependable digital environments.
            </span>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="guardian-security-model">

          <div>
            <strong>Detect</strong>
            <span>
              Identify relevant security or safety signals.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Verify</strong>
            <span>
              Evaluate trusted activity and available security evidence.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Decide</strong>
            <span>
              Determine an appropriate security response.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Enforce</strong>
            <span>
              Apply the appropriate protective action.
            </span>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="guardian-use">

          <div class="guardian-commercial-heading">
            <span>WHAT GUARDIAN-CORE CAN SUPPORT</span>
            <strong>Security-focused digital applications</strong>
          </div>

          <p>
            Guardian-Core can support digital platforms, applications,
            services and systems that require security verification,
            risk-oriented protection, trusted interactions, policy
            enforcement and safety-focused controls.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="guardian-verified">

          <div class="guardian-commercial-heading">
            <span>VERIFIED PRODUCT</span>
            <strong>Established security product baseline</strong>
          </div>

          <p>
            Guardian-Core has undergone a documented product security
            validation baseline covering installation, dependency security,
            code-quality checks, security contract testing, build validation
            and runtime smoke verification.
          </p>

          <p>
            The product is presented publicly without exposing proprietary
            implementation details, internal security mechanisms or
            sensitive technical information.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="guardian-commercial">

          <div class="guardian-commercial-heading">
